{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">四隻新股首日掛牌，當中兩隻跌破招股價。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">機械人技術公司本末科技，收報23.2元，較招股價21.6元，高約百分之7。以每手100股，不計手續費，一手帳面賺160元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.SS 1700_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261LTO2bd20V1790677727.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.SS 1700_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主要研製自動化設備的羅博特科收報414.4元，較招股價436元，低近半成。以每手50股，不計手續費，一手帳面蝕1,080元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.SS 1700_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026jVdxqb6W5E1790677745.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.SS 1700_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">PCB印製電路板生產商景旺電子收報77.05元，較招股價69.88元，高約一成。以每手100股，不計手續費，一手帳面賺717元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.SS 1700_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Y6Fn12EoZt1790677765.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JF.LISTING.SS 1700_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新型材料供應商彤程新材，收報39.98元，較招股價44元，低百分之9。以每手100股，不計手續費，一手帳面蝕402元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T11:20:12.150466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}